  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Grandpa has a box. It is a big box. It is on a chair. \"What is it?\" asks Lily. \"Ask me,\" says Grandpa. \"Is it lunch?\" \"No, it isn't.\" \"Is it a lime?\" \"No, it isn't.\"",
      "\"Is it small?\" \"Yes, it is.\" \"Is it green?\" \"No, it is black.\" \"Is it a camera?\" \"Yes, it is!\" Lily opens the box.",
      "\"Wow!\" \"For me?\" \"Yes, for you,\" says Grandpa. \"Thank you!\" Lily looks at the camera. Lily takes a photo. \"Smile, Grandpa!\" Grandpa smiles. Lily is very happy."
    ],
    "summary": "Grandpa has a box on a chair. Lily asks yes or no questions and finds a camera, and then she takes a photo of Grandpa.",
